sections.text:
1 De haereticis qui Ethnophrones dicuntur, nihil apud Epiphanium inveni, sed
Glycas verba repetit Ioannis Damasceni, De haeresib., 94 (Migne, t. XCIV, col. 758);
cf. Smith, Diction. of Christian biogr., s. v.

sections.en:
1 Concerning the heretics who are called Ethnophrones, I have found nothing in Epiphanius, but
Glycas repeats the words of John of Damascus, De haeresib., 94 (Migne, t. XCIV, col. 758);
cf. Smith, Diction. of Christian biogr., s. v.
